# Runtime dependency inputs for the shadow agent runner.
# Every entry is an exact pin and must match [project].dependencies in
# pyproject.toml (scripts/check_lock.py checks both). The image installs the
# hash-pinned lock compiled from this file by `make lock`, never this file.
